      <Text>INT. ARCHIVE - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" mm:block-id="blk_01J6NE39P900000000000000P9" mm:scene-id="scn_01J6NE39P200000000000000P2" mm:schema-version="1.0" mm:unknown-extensions='{"unicode_sample":true}'>
      <Text>A café sign hangs above Hebrew notes: שלום.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph DualDialogue="true" Type="Character" mm:block-id="blk_01J6NE39PA00000000000000PA" mm:character-cue-id="cue_01J6NE39P300000000000000P3" mm:dialogue-pair-id="dlg_01J6NE39P500000000000000P5" mm:dual-dialogue="true" mm:dual-dialogue-group-id="ddg_01J6NE39P700000000000000P7" mm:is-dual-dialogue="true" mm:is-extension="true" mm:scene-id="scn_01J6NE39P200000000000000P2" mm:schema-version="1.0">
      <Text>ADA (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph DualDialogue="true" Type="Dialogue" mm:block-id="blk_01J6NE39PB00000000000000PB" mm:dialogue-pair-id="dlg_01J6NE39P500000000000000P5" mm:dual-dialogue="true" mm:dual-dialogue-group-id="ddg_01J6NE39P700000000000000P7" mm:is-dual-dialogue="true" mm:scene-id="scn_01J6NE39P200000000000000P2" mm:schema-version="1.0">
      <Text>The letters keep their order.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph DualDialogue="true" Type="Character" mm:block-id="blk_01J6NE39PC00000000000000PC" mm:character-cue-id="cue_01J6NE39P400000000000000P4" mm:dialogue-pair-id="dlg_01J6NE39P600000000000000P6" mm:dual-dialogue="true" mm:dual-dialogue-group-id="ddg_01J6NE39P700000000000000P7" mm:is-dual-dialogue="true" mm:scene-id="scn_01J6NE39P200000000000000P2" mm:schema-version="1.0" mm:unknown-extensions='{"rtl_character":true}'>
      <Text>NOURA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph DualDialogue="true" Type="Dialogue" mm:block-id="blk_01J6NE39PD00000000000000PD" mm:dialogue-pair-id="dlg_01J6NE39P600000000000000P6" mm:dual-dialogue="true" mm:dual-dialogue-group-id="ddg_01J6NE39P700000000000000P7" mm:is-dual-dialogue="true" mm:scene-id="scn_01J6NE39P200000000000000P2" mm:schema-version="1.0" mm:unknown-extensions='{"rtl":true,"script":"arab"}'>
      <Text>مرحبا. نقرأ من اليمين.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
